<title>USA: Painewebber Inc. wins $144 mln Fairfax County, Va. [CORRECTED 21:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Painewebber Inc. wins $144 mln Fairfax County, Va. [CORRECTED 21:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Painewebber Inc. (corrects from Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.) said it won $144 million of Fairfax County, Va., public improvement unlimited tax bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.2019 percent (corrects cost).</p>
</text>
